<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Nuevo Cambio de Aceite</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
  <style>
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef4fb, #dfe9f6);
      color: #14213d;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .navbar-aceite {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #071735, #0b3b82 70%, #0f766e);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(7, 23, 53, .18);
    }
    .page-shell {
      max-width: 980px;
    }
    .card-soft {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #d8e2f0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(20, 33, 61, .08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .card-head {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0b3b82, #071735);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    }
    .card-head h1 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .card-head p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: .2rem 0 0;
    }
    .form-label {
      color: #334155;
      font-weight: 850;
    }
    .hint-box {
      background: #ecfdf5;
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: #14532d;
      font-weight: 750;
      padding: .85rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar navbar-dark navbar-aceite px-3">
  <span class="navbar-brand fw-bold"><i class="bi bi-droplet-half me-1"></i> Nuevo cambio de aceite</span>
  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 text-white flex-wrap">
    <span class="small fw-bold"><%= user.usuario %> (<%= user.rol %>)</span>
    <a href="/aceite" class="btn btn-light btn-sm fw-bold">Volver</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="container page-shell py-4">
  <section class="card-soft">
    <div class="card-head">
      <h1>Registrar cambio de aceite</h1>
      <p>Al guardar, el sistema rebaja los galones usados del estañón activo de la sede de la unidad.</p>
    </div>

    <form method="POST" action="/aceite" class="p-4">
      <div class="hint-box mb-3">
        Un estañón completo tiene 55 galones. En este formulario registre cuántos galones se usaron en el cambio.
      </div>

      <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-md-12">
          <label class="form-label">Placa</label>
          <div data-placa-search data-placa-mode="unidad" data-placa-target="#unidadAceiteId">
            <input type="text" class="form-control text-uppercase" data-placa-input data-placa-autocomplete placeholder="Escriba la placa" required>
            <input type="hidden" name="unidad_id" id="unidadAceiteId" required>
            <div data-placa-results></div>
            <div data-placa-selected class="small text-muted mt-1"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
          <label class="form-label">KM actual</label>
          <input type="number" name="km_actual" class="form-control" required>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
          <label class="form-label">Galones usados</label>
          <input type="number" step="0.01" min="0.01" name="galones_usados" class="form-control" placeholder="Ej: 5.00" required>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
          <label class="form-label">Próximo cambio (KM)</label>
          <input type="number" name="proximo_km" class="form-control" required>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12">
          <label class="form-label">Observaciones</label>
          <textarea name="observaciones" class="form-control" rows="3" placeholder="Ej: cambio completo, filtro incluido, revisión de fuga..."></textarea>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2 mt-4">
        <a href="/aceite" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Cancelar</a>
        <button class="btn btn-success fw-bold"><i class="bi bi-save"></i> Guardar y rebajar galones</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>
</main>

<script src="/js/placa-search.js?v=20260811-3"></script>
<script src="/js/loading-guard.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
